<[Dave] DHWEINSTEIN> It is important in a commmunity this small...
<[Dave] DHWEINSTEIN> ...that we keep each other up to date with what...
<[Dave] DHWEINSTEIN> ...is being done...
<[Dave] DHWEINSTEIN> ...can be done...
<[Dave] DHWEINSTEIN> ,...and should be done. This way we have more ammunition 
to use Forth in non-Forth shops.
